1
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:08,360
=Episode 11=

2
00:00:11,599 --> 00:00:13,160
(Don't hurt Yunlie.)

3
00:00:17,919 --> 00:00:18,720
Father.

4
00:00:25,679 --> 00:00:27,399
You may withdraw now.

5
00:00:27,399 --> 00:00:28,000
I'm weary.

6
00:00:29,719 --> 00:00:30,399
Father,

7
00:00:30,559 --> 00:00:31,160
Xi Yuan is...

8
00:00:31,160 --> 00:00:32,120
Leave.

9
00:00:36,039 --> 00:00:38,200
Father, please take care of yourself.

10
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:39,280
I take

11
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:41,359
my leave.

12
00:00:47,240 --> 00:00:48,320
Xi Yuan,

13
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:50,320
you really should come
with me to Xuanhan.

14
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:52,119
Stop.

15
00:00:55,759 --> 00:00:56,719
I guarantee

16
00:00:56,840 --> 00:00:58,600
it'll be way better
than staying here in Huyun.

17
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:08,240
Xi Yuan!

18
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:11,480
You can make seed drills, tractors,
and plastic greenhouses, right?

19
00:01:11,480 --> 00:01:12,560
Help us build some!

20
00:01:13,760 --> 00:01:15,239
Xi Yuan,

21
00:01:15,560 --> 00:01:16,719
teach me how to use a cellphone.

22
00:01:17,159 --> 00:01:18,200
That WeChat thing you have

23
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:20,079
works way better than sending messages
with Spiritual Power.

24
00:01:20,680 --> 00:01:22,480
And partying up in that game
is so much fun.

25
00:01:22,879 --> 00:01:23,560
Party up?

26
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:25,480
You can actually party up on your phone?

27
00:01:25,799 --> 00:01:26,879
You should've said so sooner.

28
00:01:33,959 --> 00:01:34,760
Your Highness.

29
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:36,959
Just a minor wound.

30
00:01:37,920 --> 00:01:38,719
I'm fine.

31
00:01:40,879 --> 00:01:41,719
Where is Xuan Yazhe?

32
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:43,159
Uh...

33
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:46,319
While you were recovering,
Prince Xuan Yazhe

34
00:01:46,319 --> 00:01:47,640
kept hanging around Miss Xi Yuan
every day.

35
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:48,560
They're inseparable,

36
00:01:48,560 --> 00:01:49,640
always chatting and laughing together.

37
00:01:55,519 --> 00:01:56,719
Triple kill?

38
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,159
Quadra kill!

39
00:01:59,599 --> 00:02:00,719
Penta kill!

40
00:02:01,879 --> 00:02:02,319
Too easy.

41
00:02:02,560 --> 00:02:03,879
Xi Yuan, you're amazing!

42
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:05,879
Inseparable...

43
00:02:06,840 --> 00:02:07,920
always chatting and laughing together?

44
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:16,879
Go

45
00:02:16,879 --> 00:02:18,560
tell her I'm gravely wounded

46
00:02:18,639 --> 00:02:20,000
and bring Xi Yuan to see me.

47
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:21,240
But, Your Highness,

48
00:02:21,639 --> 00:02:23,719
your wounds are nearly healed,
aren't they?

49
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:26,840
Come on!

50
00:02:27,080 --> 00:02:28,199
You're such a blockhead.

51
00:02:28,199 --> 00:02:28,879
Let's go!

52
00:02:34,199 --> 00:02:35,400
Miss Xi Yuan!

53
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:37,479
Terrible news.

54
00:02:37,479 --> 00:02:38,439
His Highness is wounded!

55
00:02:39,439 --> 00:02:40,560
Wounded?

56
00:02:41,039 --> 00:02:43,879
(Jin Yunlie will soon face
a life-or-death tribulation.)

57
00:02:44,319 --> 00:02:45,120
You take over.

58
00:02:49,479 --> 00:02:50,360
What happened to Yunlie?

59
00:02:51,719 --> 00:02:53,080
Actually, His Highness...

60
00:02:53,080 --> 00:02:53,599
Never mind.

61
00:02:53,759 --> 00:02:55,080
Prince Xuan Yazhe!

62
00:02:56,719 --> 00:02:58,479
They've only just met.

63
00:02:59,919 --> 00:03:01,319
How are they already this close?

64
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:04,159
Could it be...

65
00:03:08,439 --> 00:03:09,240
Jin Yunlie!

66
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:10,520
You're hurt?

67
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:11,960
What happened?

68
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:14,879
Just a minor wound.

69
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:17,680
I'm fine.

70
00:03:18,199 --> 00:03:21,400
A few days of rest should do.

71
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:23,960
You need days to recover,
and you call that a minor wound?

72
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:28,000
If you...

73
00:03:28,759 --> 00:03:31,400
If you don't mind...

74
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:35,599
I...

75
00:03:36,639 --> 00:03:37,479
I don't mind.

76
00:04:25,079 --> 00:04:26,319
Well? Any better?

77
00:04:31,759 --> 00:04:32,600
Jin Yunlie,

78
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:33,959
you have to promise me

79
00:04:34,199 --> 00:04:35,439
that no matter what happens,

80
00:04:35,639 --> 00:04:37,000
you won't carry it all alone.

81
00:04:37,519 --> 00:04:38,680
You have to tell me everything.

82
00:04:40,519 --> 00:04:43,399
(Is she worried about me?)

83
00:04:45,639 --> 00:04:46,439
Xi Yuan,

84
00:04:47,399 --> 00:04:49,399
from now on, stay by my side.

85
00:04:50,639 --> 00:04:51,560
Whatever happens,

86
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:53,839
don't leave my sight.

87
00:04:56,079 --> 00:04:56,519
And...

88
00:04:56,519 --> 00:04:57,680
What happened? What's wrong?

89
00:04:58,759 --> 00:05:00,000
Yunlie, how did you get hurt?

90
00:05:06,120 --> 00:05:07,920
You're barely hurt.

91
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,160
I get it.

92
00:05:13,519 --> 00:05:14,480
Yunlie,

93
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:17,240
you're jealous that I took her away,

94
00:05:17,439 --> 00:05:18,920
so you're pretending to be hurt?

95
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:23,600
And

96
00:05:24,399 --> 00:05:25,759
no matter what Xuan Yazhe says,

97
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:27,560
don't believe a word of it.

98
00:05:32,839 --> 00:05:34,040
Wait for me at the training ground.

99
00:05:39,439 --> 00:05:40,240
You stay right here.

100
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:41,399
I'll be back soon.

101
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:49,480
Yunlie, what are you doing?

102
00:05:49,480 --> 00:05:51,040
I don't want to fight you.

103
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:52,680
I challenge you to a match.

104
00:05:53,279 --> 00:05:54,240
If you lose,

105
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:57,199
you return to Xuanhan immediately.

106
00:05:58,079 --> 00:05:58,920
Yunlie,

107
00:05:59,120 --> 00:06:00,800
you know perfectly well
I can't beat you.

108
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:13,759
Fine.

109
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:15,560
I'll fight you, alright?

110
00:06:15,759 --> 00:06:16,360
So tell me,

111
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:18,279
what if you lose?

112
00:06:19,319 --> 00:06:20,399
I won't lose.

113
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:04,879
Xuan Yazhe!

114
00:07:07,439 --> 00:07:08,240
Are you alright?

115
00:07:08,439 --> 00:07:09,199
Do I look alright?

116
00:07:09,839 --> 00:07:12,560
My hands hurt, my arms hurt,
and my legs hurt.

117
00:07:12,920 --> 00:07:15,199
I swear I almost joined
my great-grandmother!

118
00:07:21,560 --> 00:07:22,839
I hit you too hard.

119
00:07:23,279 --> 00:07:24,079
I'm sorry.

120
00:07:36,199 --> 00:07:36,839
Yunlie,

121
00:07:37,399 --> 00:07:38,560
all's fair in war.

122
00:07:38,839 --> 00:07:39,360
Sorry about this.

123
00:07:45,240 --> 00:07:46,240
Ah!

124
00:08:01,399 --> 00:08:01,879
Your Highness!

125
00:08:02,720 --> 00:08:03,319
Your Highness,

126
00:08:03,639 --> 00:08:04,360
you're finally awake!

127
00:08:05,079 --> 00:08:05,600
Help me up.

128
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:13,000
How did I end up here?

129
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:14,439
Where's Xuan Yazhe?

130
00:08:14,560 --> 00:08:15,639
Prince Xuan Yazhe said

131
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:16,680
that at the training ground, you were...

132
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:19,399
You were...

133
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:21,519
Stop stammering like that.

134
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:23,399
Out with it.

135
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:24,959
You were struck by lightning,

136
00:08:24,959 --> 00:08:25,879
and then you passed out.

137
00:08:26,120 --> 00:08:26,920
What?

138
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:32,920
That brat Xuan Yazhe...

139
00:08:36,759 --> 00:08:37,199
Oh no.

140
00:08:38,679 --> 00:08:39,240
Xi Yuan!

141
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:49,519
How did I end up here?

142
00:08:58,080 --> 00:08:59,000
Xuan Yazhe?

143
00:09:00,960 --> 00:09:01,799
Ah!

144
00:09:02,919 --> 00:09:03,279
What...

145
00:09:03,759 --> 00:09:04,840
What is going on?

146
00:09:05,320 --> 00:09:06,559
Where are you taking me?

147
00:09:07,759 --> 00:09:08,320
Xi Yuan,

148
00:09:08,960 --> 00:09:10,519
I had no choice.

149
00:09:10,840 --> 00:09:13,320
The people of Xuanhan
truly can't wait any longer.

150
00:09:13,799 --> 00:09:14,240
Xi Yuan,

151
00:09:14,720 --> 00:09:16,080
please forgive me.

152
00:09:16,279 --> 00:09:17,440
Once you teach me how to farm,

153
00:09:17,559 --> 00:09:18,600
in exchange,

154
00:09:18,759 --> 00:09:20,960
I'm willing to withdraw
from the battle for the Xuanji Jade.

155
00:09:21,919 --> 00:09:22,799
The Xuanji Jade?

156
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:24,519
Not with the Xuanji Jade again.

157
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:26,240
What's so great about this thing

158
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:27,799
that all four kingdoms fight over it?

159
00:09:27,799 --> 00:09:29,360
In terms you'd understand in your world,

160
00:09:29,440 --> 00:09:30,159
the Xuanji Jade

161
00:09:30,320 --> 00:09:32,000
is basically a giant power bank.

162
00:09:32,399 --> 00:09:34,720
If any of the four guardian deities
can get hold of it

163
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:36,360
and absorb the power contained within,

164
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:37,759
it guarantees the winning kingdom

165
00:09:37,919 --> 00:09:39,120
a century of prosperity,

166
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:40,200
favorable weather, and good harvests.

167
00:09:41,159 --> 00:09:42,399
Better to rely on yourself
than on others.

168
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:45,240
If Xuanhan can grow strong on its own,

169
00:09:45,519 --> 00:09:47,080
why would we need to pray to deities?

170
00:09:47,120 --> 00:09:47,480
So

171
00:09:47,919 --> 00:09:50,120
this is why Shisi sent me here.

172
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:51,559
Xuan Yazhe,

173
00:09:51,840 --> 00:09:52,519
don't worry.

174
00:09:55,279 --> 00:09:55,559
What...

175
00:09:55,799 --> 00:09:56,720
What is this stuff?

176
00:10:01,759 --> 00:10:02,679
Your Highness, please, don't do it!

177
00:10:02,840 --> 00:10:03,919
If you're determined to go to Xuanhan

178
00:10:04,039 --> 00:10:05,440
to bring Miss Xi Yuan back,

179
00:10:05,559 --> 00:10:06,960
please, take me with you!

180
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:08,000
Then I'm coming too.

181
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:08,519
No.

182
00:10:09,559 --> 00:10:10,840
I'll go alone.

183
00:10:11,120 --> 00:10:11,799
A few days

184
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:13,360
will be enough to bring her back.

185
00:10:13,440 --> 00:10:13,840
Your Highness.

186
00:10:14,639 --> 00:10:15,240
You two

187
00:10:16,039 --> 00:10:17,000
stay here at the palace

188
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:18,480
and cover for me.

189
00:10:18,639 --> 00:10:19,759
If my father asks,

190
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:20,440
tell him

191
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:22,440
my wounds haven't healed,

192
00:10:23,159 --> 00:10:24,039
and I'm bedridden.

193
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:49,960
Great Demon Lord.

194
00:10:50,440 --> 00:10:54,039
Xi Yuan left Huyun for Xuanhan,

195
00:10:54,039 --> 00:10:55,519
and Jin Yunlie followed.

196
00:10:55,519 --> 00:10:57,600
Their path will inevitably
take them through Zhongtu.

197
00:10:58,440 --> 00:11:00,320
Zhongtu suppresses Spiritual Power,

198
00:11:00,519 --> 00:11:03,240
but it has no effect
on the use of Demonic Energy.

199
00:11:04,759 --> 00:11:08,159
I grant you the ability
to command the Demon Spirit.

200
00:11:09,159 --> 00:11:10,159
That's perfect!

201
00:11:29,200 --> 00:11:31,039
Remember,

202
00:11:31,519 --> 00:11:34,519
on this mission,
you must kill Jin Yunlie

203
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:36,240
and bring Xi Yuan

204
00:11:37,120 --> 00:11:38,559
to me.

205
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:45,799
Understood.

206
00:11:47,560 --> 00:11:53,160
♪A love letter, a passionate pursuit,
the envy of everyone♪

207
00:11:54,360 --> 00:11:59,960
♪Bouquets and heartfelt confessions,
leaving me moved and fulfilled♪

208
00:12:01,160 --> 00:12:06,760
♪No matter how long or hard our road,
I don't care♪

209
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:13,560
♪But you left me with this pain,
forever beyond redemption♪
